  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the beef kidney and cook until browned on both sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Remove the kidney from the skillet and set aside.",
    "Add the onion, carrots, and celery to the skillet and cook until the vegetables are tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic, salt, black pepper, and allspice to the skillet and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the heavy cream to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Return the beef kidney to the skillet and stir to coat with the cream sauce.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer the mixture, uncovered, until the sauce has thickened and the kidney is cooked through, about 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the chopped parsley, pomegranate molasses, and lemon juice, if using.",
    "Transfer the maqluba to a serving platter and garnish with chopped fresh mint.",
    "Serve hot."
  ],
